{"html":"<p>A city in <a class=\"kbl\" data-k=\"attica\">Attica</a> built around a rocky hill, the Acropolis. Its harbour was <a class=\"kbl\" data-k=\"piraeus\">Piraeus</a>, joined to the city by the <a class=\"kbl\" data-k=\"long-walls\">Long Walls</a>.</p><p>In the fifth century BCE it was the largest Greek city and, after <a class=\"kbl\" data-k=\"cleisthenes\">Cleisthenes</a>, a democracy. Its fleet beat Persia at <a class=\"kbl\" data-k=\"battle-of-salamis\">Salamis</a>, and its money from the <a class=\"kbl\" data-k=\"delian-league\">Delian League</a> paid for the <a class=\"kbl\" data-k=\"parthenon\">Parthenon</a>. It lost the <a class=\"kbl\" data-k=\"peloponnesian-war\">Peloponnesian War</a> to <a class=\"kbl\" data-k=\"sparta\">Sparta</a> in 404 BCE but stayed the centre of Greek thought: <a class=\"kbl\" data-k=\"socrates\">Socrates</a> taught in its streets and <a class=\"kbl\" data-k=\"plato\">Plato</a> founded the <a class=\"kbl\" data-k=\"platonic-academy\">Academy</a> outside its walls.</p><p>See <a class=\"kbl\" data-k=\"athens-golden-age\">athens-golden-age</a> for the story of its best century.</p>","links":["attica","piraeus","long-walls","cleisthenes","battle-of-salamis","delian-league","parthenon","peloponnesian-war","sparta","socrates","plato","platonic-academy","athens-golden-age"],"sum":"A city in Attica built around a rocky hill, the Acropolis. Its harbour was Piraeus, joined to the city by the Long Walls.","rel":{"part_of":["attica"]},"back":["1896-athens-olympics","aeschylus","alcibiades","alexander-sacks-thebes","antigone","aristophanes","aristotle","aspasia","athenian-democracy","athenian-owl-tetradrachm","athens-golden-age","athens-schools-closed","battle-of-aegospotami","battle-of-chaeronea","battle-of-marathon","battle-of-pylos","battle-of-salamis","battle-of-the-eurymedon","black-figure-pottery","bosporan-kingdom","cleisthenes","daphni-monastery","delian-league","delos-made-a-free-port","demosthenes","dipylon-amphora","dracos-laws"